WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.375
Thirds and quarters cannot be counted together.

2
00:00:03.926 --> 00:00:07.101
Nine parts: the quarters do not split evenly.

3
00:00:07.778 --> 00:00:12.378
Twelve parts: both split. Twelve is the lowest common multiple.

4
00:00:18.665 --> 00:00:22.215
Four twelfths and three twelfths make seven twelfths.
